WEBVTT

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:20.010
Rental Magica

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:47.660
Lapis...

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:51.100
Mr. President!

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:53.560
Promise me.

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:59.010
Never take that eyepatch off
unless your life depends on it.

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:03.880
You think you can beat Lapis
if you take off your eyepatch?

00:02:05.790 --> 00:02:06.810
Don't look!

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:09.750
No use.

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:11.830
Itsuki!

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:12.990
Brother Pres!

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:18.330
The basilisk eye...

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:24.930
Judaix put it in you?

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:32.640
Big Brother has given Lapis
the Evil Eye, which robs all sight.

00:02:32.850 --> 00:02:34.010
Now it ends.

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:52.670
Those roars!

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:53.500
No way!

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:55.430
Could it be?!

00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:00.360
Snap out of it, Itsuki!

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:04.880
Even if it is provisionally,
you're the head of a magical society!

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:27.660
Too moved by our reunion for words, huh?

00:03:28.340 --> 00:03:30.300
Why are you alive?

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:32.300
Well, nice to see you, too.

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:34.770
It's to be with you, of course.

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:37.870
And for a bit of revenge, too.

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:40.550
You should be honored!

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:42.880
I'll be your opponent now.

00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:45.320
Adelicia Lenn Mathers...

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:47.220
The head of Goetia.

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:50.050
Oh, I'm glad you haven't forgotten me.

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:54.390
That barrier kept me from showing
you any of my art back in Paris.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:58.430
Goetia is not a party to this fehde.

00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:01.300
Besides, my role here is finished.

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:02.730
Meaning what?

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:07.870
Only thing she's good at is running way.

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:09.400
Adelicia?

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:14.240
Did that alchemist tell you he'd killed me?

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:15.710
Y-Yeah.

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:19.010
I have a demon or two to sacrifice.

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:24.880
Although it took a while for even
me to recover from that eye of hers.

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:28.350
This charm was made to counteract it.

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:29.590
Charm?

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:32.800
The Eye of Horus.

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:36.390
A defense used in Egypt against the Evil Eye.

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:38.760
Then, you're really...

00:04:39.470 --> 00:04:41.470
I'm hardly a fake, aren't I?

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:46.540
Or did your eyes get so bad that
you can't tell it's the real me?

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:53.450
I-Itsuki?! Have you lost your mind! Stop it!

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:54.490
Thank God...

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:58.420
Thank God! Oh, thank God!

00:05:00.130 --> 00:05:02.600
Itsuki... You really feel that way?

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:03.930
Itsuki!
Big Brother!

00:05:03.930 --> 00:05:07.390
No matter how happy you are,
think of a better way to express it!

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:10.000
You're going to cause trouble
for Big Sister Adelicia!

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:10.990
Um, right.

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:15.170
W-Well, I won't say I found
it disagreeable, but...

00:05:15.310 --> 00:05:17.570
I'm wondering about what Lapis said.

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:20.710
About her role being finished.

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:23.610
Speaking of which, where's the
suitcase with the inheritance?

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:27.150
Honami!

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:32.120
Episode 10
TEARS OF THE HOMUNCULUS

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:48.110
Icchan?

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:49.540
Icchan?

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:58.050
NO!!!

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:15.130
Who's there?

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:19.700
This should do for now.

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:23.080
I'll make a new one and seal it later.

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:26.340
However, this boy now carries a heavy burden.

00:06:26.980 --> 00:06:28.850
I'm afraid that, for as long as he lives,

00:06:28.850 --> 00:06:31.220
this eye will summon all manner of evil to him.

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:35.790
Eventually, his eye will devour him.

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:50.330
Judaix got me?

00:06:53.310 --> 00:06:55.740
He's taken my fetishes and my broom.

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:58.110
You're awake?

00:06:58.310 --> 00:06:59.370
Judaix!

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:14.330
This clock is maintaining a barrier
to keep me from leaving, isn't it?

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:16.190
Are the president and the others all right?!

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:23.630
I don't care about anything else!
Just tell me that much!

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:26.640
There was an interloper. The head of Goetia.

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:28.670
Addie?!

00:07:28.980 --> 00:07:33.310
It seems my eye was deceived
by the heir of Solomon.

00:07:37.020 --> 00:07:40.320
However, thanks to you,
I now have the inheritance.

00:07:48.130 --> 00:07:50.690
Impossible! The Association still has the key!

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:56.890
I was the one who made this
case in the first place.

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:58.040
A note book?

00:07:58.940 --> 00:08:02.570
This is Tsukasa Iba's original grimoire.

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:05.170
Do you understand what you're doing?!

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:08.080
That goes to the winner of the fehde!

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:11.340
Have you forgotten? I'm an automaton.

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:19.450
Non-humans have no right to participate
in a fehde or to head a magical society.

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:26.470
The heir of Solomon tried to steal the
proof of what I am from my studio.

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:29.440
However, since she still lives,

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:32.000
it's just a matter of time before others find out.

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:34.200
Why go to these lengths?

00:08:34.510 --> 00:08:39.950
Because Tsukasa Iba was the one who
cured me, the one who gave me a purpose.

00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:48.110
I wish to know all that he knew,
to possess all that he possessed.

00:08:50.060 --> 00:08:56.220
And I wish to know the meaning
of all the time I spent at Astral!

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:58.860
Mage Recruiting Agency
ASTRAL
We rent mages to meet your demands.

00:08:59.570 --> 00:09:04.970
The proper thing to do is submit this to
The Association and ask for their help.

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:06.970
A parts order list?

00:09:07.510 --> 00:09:10.440
It's proof that Judaix is an automaton.

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:13.910
Brother Pres?

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:17.180
We aren't going to give these
materials to The Association.

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:19.280
Why not?!

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:21.250
Because they won't act in time!

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:24.820
Adelicia, you said yourself
that it's a bureaucracy!

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:26.980
What do you plan to do?

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:28.920
There's only one attack left in the fehde.

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:31.320
We're going to win it and rescue Honami.

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:34.860
Well then, how do you plan to beat Judaix?

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:37.940
Well, I do have one idea...

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:44.950
While the fehde is in effect, as the
head of Goetia, I can't interfere.

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:48.380
In that case, I have a favor
to ask of you, Adelicia.

00:09:48.820 --> 00:09:53.690
Or rather, I want to make a deal as
Astral's president with the head of Goetia.

00:10:03.860 --> 00:10:05.500
There's no reason for you to stand guard here.

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:08.370
This barrier will keep anyone from finding me.

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:12.000
What do you want to do, Lapis?

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:17.410
Nothing. Lapis only helps Big Brother.

00:10:18.310 --> 00:10:19.070
Nothing?

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:22.640
Big Brother is only interested in Tsukasa Iba.

00:10:25.190 --> 00:10:26.240
Intruder.

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:28.450
It can't be! Icchan?!

00:10:30.090 --> 00:10:30.920
Lapis!

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:31.720
Wait!

00:10:31.990 --> 00:10:32.930
Lapis!

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:41.390
Farewell, Honami.

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:43.540
Lapis! Lapis!

00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:59.690
Hail! By... By my own divine protection,

00:10:59.690 --> 00:11:01.180
I draw this with my blood!

00:11:02.690 --> 00:11:05.090
I... I am a descendant of the holy wood,

00:11:05.090 --> 00:11:08.580
and thus compensate for
the blood of descendants!

00:11:18.540 --> 00:11:19.300
Icchan...

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:25.010
Let my blood become a sword and
destroy the evil to the southwest!

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:43.730
Marbas!

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:53.100
Being completely reckless as usual, I see.

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:54.440
Addie!

00:11:55.010 --> 00:12:00.850
Using your own Od to break the
barrier is like sacrificing your body.

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:02.340
Where's Icchan?

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:05.140
He should be fighting Judaix by now.

00:12:05.290 --> 00:12:07.850
Then why aren't you helping him?!

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:09.180
Itsuki...

00:12:09.690 --> 00:12:12.250
...asked me to make saving you top priority.

00:12:13.260 --> 00:12:15.690
He said that Astral accepted this fehde.

00:12:15.930 --> 00:12:20.730
So he said for me to keep out of it
until there was no other choice.

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:22.260
Stubborn idiot!

00:12:23.940 --> 00:12:26.240
Oh? How did you know I was here?

00:12:26.740 --> 00:12:29.510
Because I gave Lapis one
of my business cards before.

00:12:29.780 --> 00:12:30.710
Big Brother...

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:34.110
I see. There was a path between you and it.

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:36.780
I request a final fehde battle with you.

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:41.680
Didn't the princess of Solomon
tell you that the fehde is invalid?

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:44.290
She did. I ask despite that.

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:46.620
Hm... Why?

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:51.360
Because it's how I...
How Astral does things now!

00:12:52.570 --> 00:12:55.400
Someone who fell into
the presidency by chance...

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:57.500
...thinks he can preach
about how things are done?!

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:03.200
Perhaps, but I've decided I'm going
to keep on being Astral's president.

00:13:03.610 --> 00:13:05.710
I won't run because I know I have to do it,

00:13:05.710 --> 00:13:07.580
but I'll do it in my own way!

00:13:08.820 --> 00:13:10.480
You have too high an opinion of yourself.

00:13:11.090 --> 00:13:14.890
After all, ideas and experiences aren't
passed along through your genes!

00:13:16.220 --> 00:13:18.090
As you wish, I accept your fehde.

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:20.820
I accept Astral from you!

00:13:21.160 --> 00:13:22.790
Start up, Lapis.

00:13:22.930 --> 00:13:23.420
Yes.

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:39.340
As long as Lapis is here,
I can't use my Glam Sight.

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:42.240
No, even if I did use it...

00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:45.410
What's wrong, Successor?

00:13:54.230 --> 00:13:55.460
Kuroha, defensive wall!

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:56.190
Right!

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:01.390
No... You can't be!

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:05.810
Nekoyashiki, u-upper oblique,
a little down and to the right!

00:14:05.810 --> 00:14:06.740
Water line charm!

00:14:10.110 --> 00:14:12.350
Mikan, a misogi in three secon-

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:13.780
Ah! Sorry, five seconds!

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:23.360
Even if you force it a bit, you can't seal them off.

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:26.920
It seems I have no choice
but to force that eye closed.

00:14:27.560 --> 00:14:28.820
You're using her as a shield?!

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:32.460
I'm taking back that eye, Lapis.

00:14:38.740 --> 00:14:41.500
Engulf them in darkness, eye of basilisk!

00:14:44.510 --> 00:14:48.170
As I thought, the effect of catalyzing
it with my spell power is high.

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:50.910
Big... Brother...

00:14:51.590 --> 00:14:56.180
Get up, or else I'll tear out your
other eye and throw you away!

00:14:56.820 --> 00:15:00.020
It would be more efficient for me!

00:15:04.970 --> 00:15:05.620
Itsuki!

00:15:06.030 --> 00:15:07.830
What have you done, Judaix?!

00:15:08.270 --> 00:15:11.240
Oh? I'm impressed you escaped from that room.

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:12.900
The basilisk eye!

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:14.540
Don't worry.

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:17.680
The eye by itself lacks the power to kill people.

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:21.410
At best, it can rob your
astral body of its six senses.

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:26.350
You intend to carry on the fehde?

00:15:26.950 --> 00:15:29.220
You still haven't answered one question.

00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:36.320
The question our hack of a
president would ask if he were able!

00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:38.590
What did you do to Lapis?!

00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:42.660
I merely took back what I gave her.

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:45.530
Honami...

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:50.610
Then let the fehde continue!

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:54.740
I see. Then take heed!

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:07.560
Big Brother, not that!

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:10.290
Be changed.

00:16:25.610 --> 00:16:26.810
The one we faced?!

00:16:27.780 --> 00:16:28.610
Yes...

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:32.220
It was a pleasant coincidence
that the basilisk eye,

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:36.090
which I had stored in the ruins
and protected with a barrier,

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:40.290
retook its original form due
to spell wave contamination.

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:46.120
Thanks to you people, I didn't have
to waste my time retrieving it.

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:48.500
Honami, get back!

00:16:56.610 --> 00:16:57.540
Lapis is...

00:16:59.850 --> 00:17:04.880
No. It's a basilisk, the king of poison
serpents, which died out in the age of myth.

00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:07.080
Just how far will you go...

00:17:07.650 --> 00:17:08.210
Hm?

00:17:09.520 --> 00:17:11.750
How can you be?!

00:17:17.600 --> 00:17:18.460
Icchan!

00:17:18.870 --> 00:17:19.760
Itsuki...

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:29.840
Icchan!

00:17:30.840 --> 00:17:33.440
Honami... I'm breaking my promise.

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:40.580
I can't look at it.

00:17:44.260 --> 00:17:45.750
I can't look at those eyes.

00:17:49.130 --> 00:17:51.120
Basilisk! Cut him down!

00:17:56.140 --> 00:17:56.970
Lapis...

00:17:59.210 --> 00:18:02.510
Lapis, that's why you said that, isn't it?

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:04.970
That until you died, you'd never get it.

00:18:07.110 --> 00:18:10.610
That you'd never get what you wanted most.

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:15.680
The Eye of Horus!

00:18:16.390 --> 00:18:18.950
Are you ready, Judaix?

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:21.960
That eye... It doesn't just see all, does it?

00:18:22.030 --> 00:18:24.190
It can manipulate the flow of spell power, too?!

00:18:25.900 --> 00:18:29.030
You shall atone for your obsession!

00:18:37.540 --> 00:18:38.370
You...

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:41.150
I'm not my father.

00:18:42.280 --> 00:18:44.580
I don't run the company like he did.

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:48.780
I will be who I will be.

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:53.360
I'm not the man I will become yet.

00:18:53.930 --> 00:18:55.920
But someday, surely...

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:58.470
So please, you, too...

00:18:58.470 --> 00:19:00.470
Become the sort of person...

00:19:00.470 --> 00:19:03.930
The sort of person my father would be proud of.

00:19:14.410 --> 00:19:16.610
Welcome back, Lapis.

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:55.680
The sort of person
Tsukasa Iba would be proud of?

00:20:16.010 --> 00:20:16.870
Lapis...

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:20.180
You didn't leave with the others?

00:20:22.120 --> 00:20:25.520
Go if you wish to go. I don't need you.

00:20:25.850 --> 00:20:28.450
Lapis will not go.

00:20:29.890 --> 00:20:32.950
Lapis will stay with Big Brother forever.

00:20:35.200 --> 00:20:37.760
Lapis will stay with Big Brother forever.

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:42.640
You...

00:20:49.210 --> 00:20:51.180
It's a letter from Lapis!

00:20:52.950 --> 00:20:56.580
If you wish to know about the eye,
it's in the original grimoire.

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:58.250
Judaix.

00:20:58.450 --> 00:21:01.150
It also says "Take care."

00:21:01.420 --> 00:21:02.820
From Egypt, huh?

00:21:02.990 --> 00:21:06.930
Judaix must be after something again.

00:21:07.230 --> 00:21:08.560
Excuse me.

00:21:09.300 --> 00:21:10.350
Adelicia?

00:21:10.900 --> 00:21:13.960
I'm here to finalize our formal contract.

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:15.230
Contract?

00:21:15.640 --> 00:21:17.540
Oh, didn't you hear?

00:21:17.770 --> 00:21:24.970
Itsuki agreed to turn Judaix's
20% control of Astral over to me.

00:21:25.480 --> 00:21:28.210
Um, well, it was the only way
she could help us with the fehde.

00:21:28.380 --> 00:21:29.940
It couldn't be helped!

00:21:30.480 --> 00:21:31.750
"It couldn't be helped"?

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:34.950
I suppose this makes me a major
stockholder now, doesn't it?

00:21:35.090 --> 00:21:38.460
It puts me a bit higher than you
rank and file employees, huh?

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:40.930
Oh, you haven't actually signed the contract yet?

00:21:40.930 --> 00:21:42.950
Then we'll disregard it.

00:21:44.330 --> 00:21:45.730
W-What are you doing?!

00:21:45.970 --> 00:21:47.730
Boss, what's the big idea?!

00:21:47.870 --> 00:21:48.630
Itsuki!

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:51.510
Hold it! Explain this!

00:21:51.510 --> 00:21:52.770
Wait just a second!

00:21:52.840 --> 00:21:56.100
Hold it! I just told you!
There was no other way at the time!

00:21:58.210 --> 00:22:07.810
Over and over, holding my wounded hand...
Kizutsuku te wo nandomo tsunaide

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:16.220
...you walk this uncertain path with me...
fuan bakari no kono michi wo aruite

00:22:17.500 --> 00:22:29.270
...amidst the days as they slowly drift by.
yukkuri nagareta hibi no naka de bokura ga

00:22:29.540 --> 00:22:41.190
The things we obtain are so warm, so beloved.
Te ni shita mono wa konna ni atatakute itoshinda

00:22:41.190 --> 00:22:47.460
Please, as time goes by, let's keep right on...
Nee konomama toki no naka

00:22:47.530 --> 00:22:51.960
...laughing and walking together.
waratte aruite yukou

00:22:52.830 --> 00:22:56.240
It's because you're with me...
Kimi ga iru kara

00:22:56.240 --> 00:23:01.330
...that I can keep moving forward.
mae ni susumerunda

00:23:02.280 --> 00:23:13.210
Now our feelings are becoming one...
Ima bokura no omoi ga hitotsu ni natte

00:23:13.590 --> 00:23:17.260
...and showing the path to us.
michi wo shimesunda

00:23:17.260 --> 00:23:21.490
So please, keep on holding my hand...
Dakara kono te zutto

00:23:21.600 --> 00:23:24.590
...and never let it go...
